nking"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Polymer processing"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the principles of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Extrusion"},{"text":"Injection moulding"},{"text":"Blow moulding"},{"text":"Compression moulding"},{"text":"Compounding"},{"text":"Blending"},{"text":"Pelletisation"},{"text":"Film processing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Polymer additives"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Plasticisers"},{"text":"Antioxidants"},{"text":"Stabilizers"},{"text":"Fillers"},{"text":"Pigments"},{"text":"Flame retardants"},{"text":"Processing aids"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 — Production & Process Optimisation"},{"type":"p","text":"If the programme includes a fourth year, focus on industrial employability."},{"type":"h","text":"Production calculations"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Material balance"},{"text":"Batch calculations"},{"text":"Yield"},{"text":"Conversion"},{"text":"Material consumption"},{"text":"Scrap percentage"},{"text":"Production efficiency"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Quality systems"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SOPs"},{"text":"Batch records"},{"text":"Specifications"},{"text":"In-process controls"},{"text":"OOS"},{"text":"CAPA"},{"text":"Deviation management"},{"text":"Change control"},{"text":"Traceability"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Process improvement"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"5S"},{"text":"Kaizen"},{"text":"Lean manufacturing"},{"text":"5 Whys"},{"text":"Fishbone analysis"},{"text":"Pareto analysis"},{"text":"SPC"},{"text":"Process capability"},{"text":"Basic DOE"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital production"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Basic Python"},{"text":"ERP/MES fundamentals"},{"text":"Production dashboards"}]}]},{"heading":"Four-Year Development Plan","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Main Focus","Practical Output"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Chemistry, laboratory and safety"},{"text":"Analytical chemistry project"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Industrial processes and instrumentation"},{"text":"Process-analysis project"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Polymer chemistry and processing"},{"text":"Polymer production project"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Quality, Lean and optimisation"},{"text":"Production-improvement project"}]]}]},{"heading":"Practical Project Roadmap","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Polymer Compounding Study"},{"type":"p","text":"Investigate how changing an additive/filler concentration affects:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Tensile strength"},{"text":"Hardness"},{"text":"Density"},{"text":"Flexibility"},{"text":"Thermal behaviour"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Present the results statistically."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Process Parameter Optimisation"},{"type":"p","text":"At laboratory scale, study how controlled changes in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Temperature"},{"text":"Reaction time"},{"text":"Concentration"},{"text":"Mixing speed"}]},{"type":"p","text":"affect:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Yield"},{"text":"Conversion"},{"text":"Viscosity"},{"text":"Product quality"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use statistical analysis to identify favourable conditions."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Production Yield Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Create an Excel/Power BI dashboard tracking:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Batch size"},{"text":"Raw-material consumption"},{"text":"Yield"},{"text":"Scrap"},{"text":"Rejection"},{"text":"Downtime"},{"text":"Production efficiency"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Production Deviation Investigation"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a simulated case such as:"},{"type":"p","text":"Product viscosity exceeds specification."},{"type":"p","text":"Investigate potential causes:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Raw-material variation"},{"text":"Temperature"},{"text":"Mixing time"},{"text":"Agitation"},{"text":"Formulation"},{"text":"Instrument error"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Apply:"},{"type":"flow","items":["5 Whys","Fishbone","Pareto"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"and recommend corrective action."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Polymer Quality Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Study relationships between:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Melt-flow index"},{"text":"Tensile strength"},{"text":"Elongation"},{"text":"Hardness"},{"text":"Density"},{"text":"Processing temperature"}]},{"type":"p","text":"and final product performance."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 6 — Sustainable Production"},{"type":"p","text":"Design a process-improvement study aimed at reducing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Chemical waste"},{"text":"Energy consumption"},{"text":"Water usage"},{"text":"Scrap"},{"text":"Solvent consumption"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Quantify the potential improvement."}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"h","text":"Polymer & Plastics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Polymer manufacturing"},{"text":"Plastic processing"},{"text":"Polymer compounding"},{"text":"Masterbatch"},{"text":"Resin manufacturing"},{"text":"Rubber manufacturing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Chemical Industry"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Specialty chemicals"},{"text":"Petrochemicals"},{"text":"Paints"},{"text":"Coatings"},{"text":"Adhesives"},{"text":"Dyes and pigments"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Other industries"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Pharmaceuticals"},{"text":"Cosmetics"},{"text":"Food chemicals"},{"text":"Water treatment"},{"text":"Consumer chemicals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Internship titles"},{"type":"p","text":"Search for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Production Intern"},{"text":"Production Trainee"},{"text":"Process Chemistry Intern"},{"text":"Manufacturing Intern"},{"text":"QC Intern"},{"text":"Process Development Intern"},{"text":"Polymer Processing Intern"},{"text":"Chemical 